(
    version: 1,
    command: "ses",
    description: Some("Amazon Simple Email Service  This document contains reference information for the Amazon Simple Email Service (Amazon SES) API, version 2010-12-01. This document is best used in conjunction with the Amazon SES Developer Guide.    For a list of Amazon SES endpoints to use in service requests, see Regions and Amazon SES in the Amazon SES Developer Guide.  This documentation contains reference information related to the following:    Amazon SES API Actions     Amazon SES API Data Types     Common Parameters     Common Errors"),
